          "dense_rank": 1,
          "lexical_score": 29.26731,
          "lexical_rank": 1,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Aetna\n\nWe are in-network with Aetna Choice POS II and Aetna Open Access Managed Choice. Aetna Medicare Advantage PPO plans are in-network as well. Plans administered by Aetna Signature Administrators use a separate network, and we are not part of it.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.5302993,
          "dense_rank": 2,
          "lexical_score": 9.589598,
          "lexical_rank": 2,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## UnitedHealthcare\n\nWe are in-network with UnitedHealthcare Choice Plus and UnitedHealthcare Options PPO. UnitedHealthcare Navigate HMO is not in-network. AARP Medicare Advantage plans from UnitedHealthcare are in-network when the plan is a PPO, and not in-network when it is an HMO.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.47730574,
          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": 4.292705,
          "lexical_rank": 4,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Cigna\n\nWe are in-network with Cigna Open Access Plus (OAP) and Cigna PPO plans. Cigna LocalPlus plans are in-network only for members who live in our county; the network area is printed on the back of the card. Cigna Connect plans bought through the health insurance marketplace are not in-network.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.43999732,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": 4.128022,
          "lexical_rank": 5,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n\nThis guide lists, plan by plan, the health insurance plans we are in-network with. Insurance companies sell many plans under one brand name, and being in-network with a company does not mean being in-network with every plan it sells. Check the plan name printed on the front of your insurance card - it usually appears next to the company logo or under \"Plan\" - and compare it with the lists below.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.43950692,
          "dense_rank": 5,
          "lexical_score": 4.082186,
          "lexical_rank": 6,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Blue Cross Blue Shield\n\nWe are in-network with Blue Cross Blue Shield PPO plans, including BlueCard PPO members whose plan was issued in another state; look for the suitcase logo with the letters \"PPO\" on your card. The Federal Employee Program (FEP) Basic Option and Standard Option plans are in-network too. We are not in-network with Blue Essentials HMO or Blue Advantage HMO plans, because those plans only cover care from their own medical groups.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 23,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.3841418,
          "dense_rank": 6,
          "lexical_score": 5.1391983,
          "lexical_rank": 3,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Which health insurance plans do you accept?\nAnswer: We accept most major insurance providers, including Blue Cross Blue Shield, Aetna, Cigna, UnitedHealthcare, and Medicare. If you're unsure whether your specific plan is covered, you can ask me to connect you with a member of our friendly front desk team. They'll be happy to help clarify your coverage.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 24,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.37114012,
          "dense_rank": 7,
          "lexical_score": 3.503395,
          "lexical_rank": 7,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insu",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 5,
          "similarity_score": 0.31251648,
          "dense_rank": 8,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Medicare and Medicaid\n\nWe accept Original Medicare (Part B) for medical visits. Medicare does not cover routine dental care, so dental appointments are self-pay for Medicare ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 6,
          "similarity_score": 0.31153005,
          "dense_rank": 9,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Copays and deductibles\n\nYour plan decides how much you pay at the visit. A copay is a fixed amount your plan sets for each visit, and it is collected when you check in. If yo",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 30,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.30727667,
          "dense_rank": 10,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Dental care guide\n## Dental insurance\n\nMedical insurance plans do not cover dental care. For dental appointments we accept these dental plans: Delta Dental PPO, MetLife PDP Plus and Guardian DentalG",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 7,
          "similarity_score": 0.2987021,
          "dense_rank": 11,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Updating your insurance\n\nIf your insurance has changed since your last visit, tell the front desk at check-in and fill in Form IC-2, the Insurance Update Form, so the claim g",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 38,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.2800709,
          "dense_rank": 12,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n\nYour itemized receipt lists each procedure done at your visit by its billing code. Medical procedures use five-digit CPT codes, and dental procedures use CDT cod",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 38,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.27461058,
          "dense_rank": 13,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n## A code you do not recognise\n\nIf your receipt shows a code that is not in this list, the front desk can tell you what it is.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 31,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.27006721,
          "dense_rank": 14,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Preparing for tests at the clinic\n\nSome tests are done at the clinic during a regular appointment. This guide explains how to prepare for each of them. If your doctor has given you different instruc",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 22,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.26554528,
          "dense_rank": 15,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.26321107,
          "dense_rank": 16,
          "lexical_score": 3.330293,
          "lexical_rank": 8,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## While you wait\n\nFree guest Wi-Fi is available in the waiting area: the network is called VisitDoc-Guest, and the password is printed on the card at the front desk. Ple",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 21,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.25506344,
          "dense_rank": 17,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I bring to my first appointment?\nAnswer: Please bring a valid photo ID, your insurance card, and any relevant prior lab or test results related to your case.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 26,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.25344473,
          "dense_rank": 18,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: When is payment due, and what payment methods do you accept?\nAnswer: Payment is due at the time of service. We accept cash, major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express),",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.2532929,
          "dense_rank": 19,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## The self-check-in kiosk\n\nReturning patients can check in at the kiosk beside the front desk instead of queuing. Scan the QR code from your 48-hour reminder text, or ty",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 38,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.25124556,
          "dense_rank": 20,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n## Medical procedures\n\n- 93000: resting 12-lead electrocardiogram, with the doctor's reading of it - $65\n- 94010: spirometry - $85\n- 93784: 24-hour ambulatory blo",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.25043625,
          "dense_rank": 21,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Bringing someone with you\n\nYou may bring one adult companion into the consulting room. Anyone else who comes with you can wait in the waiting area.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 20,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.24660416,
          "dense_rank": 22,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do I need a referral from a primary care doctor to book with a specialist?\nAnswer: You can book a visit with any of our practitioners without a referral.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 32,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.24190538,
          "dense_rank": 23,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Vaccinations\n## COVID-19 vaccine\n\nWe offer the updated COVID-19 vaccine for the current season made by Pfizer-BioNTech (Comirnaty). We do not stock the Moderna (Spikevax) or Novavax vaccines.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.2323026,
          "dense_rank": 24,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Registering as a new patient\n\nNew patients fill in three forms at their first visit:\n\n- Form PR-1, New Patient Registration: your contact details, emergency contact an",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.23041165,
          "dense_rank": 25,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Email\n\nWe use email only to confirm a new appointment and to send an itemized receipt you have asked for. We do not send test results or medical",
          "text_truncated": true
        }
      ],
